      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "A mule is the offspring of a male donkey and a female horse. Horses and donkeys are different species, with different numbers of chromosomes. Of the two F1 hybrids between these two species, a mule is easier to obtain than a hinny (the offspring of a male horse and a female donkey). All male mules and most female mules are infertile"
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme": [
